   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-r-53",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1240,
   "y": 466,
   "width": 660,
   "height": 128,
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "dashed",
   "roughness": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.183Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.183Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-54",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1256,
   "y": 476,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "HTTPS :443 listener \u00b7 regional ACM cert (CERTIFICATE_ARN) or self-signed",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.183Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.183Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-55",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1256,
   "y": 500,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "TLS policy ELBSecurityPolicy-TLS13-1-2-Res-PQ-2025-09 \u00b7 ALB idle timeout 120 s\nP4 health \u2192 :4000 \u00b7 P5 header \u2192 :4000 \u00b7 P6 /* \u2192 403 (P4\u2013P6 only with CloudFront on)\nP8\u2013P16 middleware paths \u2192 :3000, no header condition\nP99 /* \u2192 :4000 \u00b7 default \u2192 :4000 \u00b7 used when CloudFront is off\nWith CloudFront on, P5 matches before P8\u2013P16, so header-bearing\nrequests on :443 all reach LiteLLM (CloudFront itself uses :80)",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.183Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.183Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-r-56",
