  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-64",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 592,
   "y": 672,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "Virtual keys \u00b7 sk-\u2026",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-65",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 592,
   "y": 692,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "issued by /key/generate: master key or proxy_admin only\nstored hashed in RDS; per-key models, budget, rpm / tpm\nspend in RDS \u00b7 rate-limit counters in Valkey\nLiteLLM checks every call: bad or missing key \u2192 401",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-r-66",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 990,
   "y": 660,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 112,
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-67",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1000,
   "y": 668,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "Middleware auth",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-68",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1000,
   "y": 688.25,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "passes the caller's Bearer key through to LiteLLM\nchat history is keyed by a hash of the API key;\nanother key on the same session gets 401\nOkta JWT (OKTA_ISSUER set): /user/new binds sub \u2192\ninternal_user and calls LiteLLM with the master key",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-r-69",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1450,
   "y": 660,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 112,
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-70",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1460,
   "y": 668,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "CloudFront \u2192 ALB shared secret",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-71",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1460,
   "y": 688.25,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "X-CloudFront-Secret: litellm-cf-<32 random chars>\nrandom_password keyed on the stack name,\nso it is stable across deploys\nexposed only as a sensitive Terraform output\nsecond layer: the ALB SG already admits only CloudFront",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "rt-t-72",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 806,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "Source: modules/ecs/alb.tf, cloudfront.tf, ecs.tf and middleware/app.py, branch sandbox-deploy \u00b7 drawn 2026-10-22",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T07:40:15.184Z",
   "version": 1
  }
